sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Tailnet User
    participant Browser as Browser Client
    participant Ingress as Tailscale Serve
    participant Edge as Voice Edge / Pipecat
    participant Broker as Inference Broker
    participant Pi as Pi Voice Service
    participant Model as Model Provider
    participant VM as Gondolin Voice VM

    User->>Browser: Start or unmute, then speak
    Browser->>Ingress: Stream microphone audio over WebRTC
    Ingress->>Edge: Proxy the authenticated session
    Edge->>Edge: Apply selected RNNoise or VoxLock input filter
    Edge->>Edge: Detect the completed turn with VAD and Smart Turn
    Edge->>Broker: Transcribe the completed turn with Parakeet v3 on MLX
    Broker-->>Edge: Transcript
    Edge->>Broker: Start an OpenAI-compatible Pi completion stream
    Broker->>Pi: Forward the new conversational turn over loopback
    Pi->>Model: Request model completion
    opt Workspace tool is needed
        Pi->>VM: Run read, write, edit, or shell
        VM-->>Pi: Bounded tool result
    end
    Model-->>Pi: Response deltas
    Pi-->>Broker: Stream response deltas with SSE
    Broker-->>Edge: Stream OpenAI-compatible completion chunks
    loop Each complete spoken text segment
        Edge->>Broker: Synthesize with MLX Kokoro
        Broker-->>Edge: 24 kHz PCM
        Edge-->>Browser: Stream speech over WebRTC
    end
    Edge-->>Browser: Publish final Mermaid and spoken text over RTVI
    Browser-->>User: Play speech and render diagram and transcript
